OBJECTIVE

Make the existing shared authorization package the common PolicyEvaluator for Knowledge Base authorization.

The goal is:

Client
↓
PEP
↓
packages/authorization PolicyEvaluator
↓
existing KB SQL/RPC decision functions
↓
RLS / database enforcement
↓
permission_audit_log

Do NOT change the underlying permission semantics in this wave.

This is an architectural consolidation, not a behavior change.

STEP 1 — AUDIT CURRENT KB PDP

Inspect all current KB authorization paths, including:

* apps/kb-admin/src/lib/pdp/**
* kb_access_grants
